cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PHI-CTRL: Physics-Hybrid Integrity Flight Control for Fault-Conditioned Reconfiguration on an F-16 Aircraft"
abstract: >-
  PHI-CTRL is a physics-hybrid integrity flight control architecture
  validated on the nonlinear 6-DOF JSBSim F-16 plant under control-surface
  effectiveness loss and coupled propulsion ceiling faults. It integrates a
  verified Total Energy Control System (TECS) baseline, an inner-loop
  pitch-rate MRAC, an 8-channel multivariate CNN-BiLSTM sequence estimator,
  and an integrity-gated PPO residual policy, bounded by an analytical
  Small-Gain stability margin and formal simulation plant verification contracts.
